{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15204460","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15204460","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1520446001:0":{"text":"灵体已经消失了……","source_cn":"灵体已经消失了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4693A1618A6D35FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520446002:0":{"text":"毕竟只是一个不完整术式的产物。","source_cn":"毕竟只是一个不完整术式的产物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02424714E24138F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520446003:0":{"text":"没关系……已经足够了。魔法师大人，谢谢你们！","source_cn":"没关系……已经足够了。魔法师大人，谢谢你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58FCE469C88B4BCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520446004:0":{"text":"我也已经想好了，我还是回营地，继续照顾大家。","source_cn":"我也已经想好了，我还是回营地，继续照顾大家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54E23D1EFAD92B11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520446005:0":{"text":"还有……关于真相……希望你们可以继续帮我一起保密，暂时不要告诉其他人。","source_cn":"还有……关于真相……希望你们可以继续帮我一起保密，暂时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAA257A67A64EC8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520